    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald is proud to present No. 46 Fortfield Drive to the market, a truly stunning A3-rated three-bedroom residence finished to an exceptional standard throughout. Occupying an enviable position in this highly sought-after location, it is rare for a home of such calibre and contemporary style to come to the market.\n\nBuilt in 2016, this fine home combines modern design with a practical and thoughtfully considered layout, maximising natural light and space throughout. Boasting luxurious contemporary interiors, high-quality finishes such as triple glazing throughout and elegant detailing, the property has been meticulously maintained and is presented in turnkey condition.\n\nBeyond the attractive exterior lies an outstanding home designed with comfortable everyday living in mind. The ground floor accommodation comprises a warm and inviting living room / bedroom 3 to the front, featuring a beautiful bay window which floods the room with natural light. To the rear is a superb open-plan kitchen/dining area with expansive glazing and sliding doors opening onto a sunny, private rear garden, creating the perfect space for both entertaining and family living. The ground floor further benefits from underfloor heating throughout, adding both comfort and efficiency, while a welcoming entrance hall and shower room complete the accommodation at this level.\n\nUpstairs, there are two generous double bedrooms, both with built-in wardrobes, together with a stylish and contemporary family bathroom. A separate utility room provides excellent additional storage and practicality.\n\nOutside, the rear garden is beautifully landscaped with a combination of patio and low maintenance astro turf grass, offering an ideal setting for outdoor dining and relaxation. The property also benefits from a valuable side passage providing convenient external access.\n\nDescription of this fine home would not be complete without mention of its convenient location. Equidistant to both Terenure and Templeogue villages with a wide variety of both primary and secondary schools on your doorstep. An abundance of amenities such as Bushy Park, Templeogue Tennis Club, a variety of cafés, shops and excellent public transport links, while the M50 is also easily accessible, ensuring seamless connectivity to the city centre and beyond.\n\nViewing is highly recommended!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHall - 4.34m x 4.40m\nTiled floor, spiral staircase and alarm control panel.\n\nLiving Room/Bedroom 3 - 3.82m x 3.61m\nTiled flooring, bay window, and built-in wardrobe.\n\nShower Room - 1.56m x 3.21m\nFully tiled, WC, wash hand basin, LED mirror, rain shower, chrome heated towel rail and recessed lighting.\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 7.13m x 5.27m\nTiled floor and splashback, built-in kitchen units, recessed lighting, Siemens oven, microwave and hob, Bosch dishwasher, Samsung fridge freezer, stainless steel sink, built-in gas fireplace.\n\nBedroom 1 - 5.23m x 3.56m\nCarpet flooring, built-in wardrobes, recessed lighting and dormer window.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.57m x 4.74m\nCarpet flooring, built-in wardrobes and recessed lighting.\n\nBathroom - 1.72m x 3.01m\nFully tiled, WC, wash hand basin, LED mirror, bathtub and chrome heated towel rail.\n\nUtility Room - 1.48m x 1.01m\nSamsung washing machine and dryer.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>A3-rated 3-bed detached house</li><li>Air-to-water heat pump</li><li>Off-street parking (for 2 cars)</li><li>High spec finish</li><li>7ft gate (wired for electric)</li><li>Underfloor heating downstairs </li><li>EV charger</li><li>Side passage</li><li>Wheelchair accessible</ul>"
